H2 MySQL mode supports CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS. Yes.

Also update request_log operation comment: 'CREATE / MERGE / DELETE / RESOLVE'.

**ObservationService changes**:

Generalize WriteOutcome to `WriteOutcome<T>(int status, T body)`. Update create/merge/delete to return `WriteOutcome<ObservationResponse>`. checkReplay/insertPlaceholder become generic with Class<T> bodyType. complete generic.

